{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054380/extras/SONOKUNI_Breakers_takeru_BK_tono.png?t=1743440659\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in <strong>up-close-and-personal combat</strong> against bizarre genetically mutated enemies. <strong>Attack, parry and bend time to your will</strong> to make it out clean on the other side. Fail and <strong>gain the wisdom needed to refine your strategy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054380/extras/Sonokuni_GIF1_600w.gif?t=1743440659\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054380/extras/SONOKUNI_Breakers_ogu_BK_tono.png?t=1743440659\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of <strong>Takeru, a lone assassin</strong> tasked with raiding a surreal superpower empowered by biotechnology. Join in her struggle to balance the morality of <strong>extreme violence</strong> against the defence of her own people, in a story inspired by <strong>real-life Japanese mythology</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054380/extras/Sonokuni_GIF4_600w.gif?t=1743440659\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054380/extras/SONOKUNI_Breakers_hayato_BK_tono.png?t=1743440659\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let the <strong>intense hip hop soundscape</strong> and <strong>neon-soaked visuals </strong>assault your senses until they are raw. Every moment is punctuated with a visceral soundtrack from Japanese developer and hip hop group, <strong>DON YASA CREW</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054380/extras/Sonokuni_GIF_5_600w.gif?t=1743440659\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054380/extras/SONOKUNI_Breakers_wanokunijin_BK_tono.png?t=1743440659\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Know Thyself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2054380/28e0c6d48210865396b5d4ecaa44153143582de5.jpg"},{"name":"Do You Like Hurting Other People?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2054380/a05c73f5374ed6084fb13fb43da6bae543b93a1c.jpg"},{"name":"Hotline Sonokuni","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2054380/8aa2f731cc9a3e68aa0f3f1cea57001b62a1cdb4.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2054380/0e019da3140cc459b3fb2688ac86cd54e6833f4a.jpg"},{"name":"Speedster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2054380/89c26c16056bd0fb0fea63f9b5f1408dbed88012.jpg"},{"name":"Like the Wind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2054380/2152ad7b8c72ad6f69fd24010cde0968544d5969.jpg"},{"name":"Lightning Quick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2054380/b2863273c10e0d4d04f370b3248a7e52889c8d65.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Demon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2054380/0338c231ef5600a19e7d6862fe7f63be353ef64c.jpg"},{"name":"Psycho Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2054380/35269cd8ecbf90caab44dca11076f68f773426b5.jpg"},{"name":"Untouchable Murder God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2054380/a43e6299be8e52c7c47cae74e67e5eab35814348.jpg"}],"total":10